not a url: InvalidUrl("not a url")
no scheme: InvalidUrl("example.com/page")
empty: InvalidUrl("")
another scheme: InvalidUrl("ftp://127.0.0.1/file")
a port that is none: InvalidUrl("http://127.0.0.1:99999/")
a posted one: InvalidUrl("not a url")
nobody listens: Connect
the server goes away: ClosedEarly
in the head: ClosedEarly
in the body: ClosedEarly
no HTTP: InvalidResponse
a response: Ok
